== Walkthrough ==

''[[Guard Kwint]] patrols the area near -12, -265.''

You say, 'Hail, Guard Kwint'

: Guard Kwint says 'Hail, _____!  Are you new to Qeynos?  If you are, I highly recommend stopping by the Lion's Mane Tavern for the best ale in Antonica.  Oh, did I mention that my brother Earron is the master brewer there?  Tell him [Kwint sent] you.'

'''Find Earron Huntlan inside the Lion's Mane and tell him Kwint sent you.'''

You say, 'Kwint sent me.'

: Earron Huntlan says 'Kwint?  Gave you the line about being my brother, huh?  That boy sends me more customers, I tells ya!  I give him one free drink for every person he gets to come in.  Hey, could you do me a favor and take this voucher to him when you are done drinking?  Thanks.'

'''Receive a note which reads it is "good for one free ale". You can return it to the guard...'''

: Guard Kwint says 'Hey.  Thanks!  Sorry about that 'he's my brother' bit but I am sure you had a good time at the Lion's Mane anyway.  I sure didn't lie to you about the quality of the ale there.'

